          "content": "\n\nHere's a prompt template you can use with DALL-E, Midjourney, or any image AI:\n\n---\n\n## Header Image Prompt\n\n```\nCreate a wide banner image for a diving club email newsletter header.\n\nDimensions: 1200×400 pixels (displays at 600×200 in email, retina-ready)\nOrientation: landscape, wide format\n\nContent:\n- Title text \"BULLES ET AVENTURES\" in ornate gold/champagne serif font (#d4a843), \n  centered, large, with subtle text shadow\n- Subtitle \"votre newsletter plongée\" in italic gold, smaller, below the title\n- NO month or date text (will be added dynamically)\n- Leave ~60px clear space at the bottom for the dynamic month overlay\n\nScene: underwater atmosphere\n- Deep ocean blue gradient background (#003366 to #0077be)\n- Soft light rays filtering from above\n- Scattered bubbles (translucent, various sizes)\n- Subtle underwater particles/plankton\n\nStyle: painterly, slightly fantastical, warm underwater lighting\nDo NOT include: fish, divers, coral, text other than the title, borders, frames\nKeep the bottom edge clean (it connects to the article cards below)\n```\n\n## Footer Image Prompt\n\n```\nCreate a wide banner image for a diving club email newsletter footer.\n\nDimensions: 1200×400 pixels (displays at 600×200 in email, retina-ready)\nOrientation: landscape, wide format\n\nContent: NO TEXT at all\n\nScene: underwater seabed panorama\n- Colorful coral reef along the bottom\n- Tropical fish (angelfish, clownfish, small schools)\n- A sunken galleon/shipwreck on the right side, partially covered in coral\n- A scuba diver silhouette on the left side, swimming with a manta ray\n- Wooden signpost in the sand (blank or with generic dive destination names)\n- Bubbles rising from the diver\n\nColors: rich ocean blues (#003366 base), warm coral oranges, tropical greens\nStyle: painterly, slightly fantastical, same atmosphere as the header\nKeep the top edge clean with a soft gradient to #003366 (connects to cards above)\n```\n\n---\n\n**Key specs for email compatibility:**\n- **Generate at 1200×400px** (2× for retina), display at `width=\"600\"` in HTML\n- **File format**: JPEG, quality 80-85%, keep under 150KB per image\n- **Top/bottom edges**: should blend into `#003366` so they connect seamlessly with the card area\n- **No critical content in the outer 10%** — some email clients crop edges\n- **Test at 320px wide** (mobile) — text should still be legible\n\n**For the dynamic month label**, the app renders it as HTML text below the header:\n```html\n<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;color:#d4a843;font-style:italic\">\n  Avril 2026\n</span>\n```\n\nThis sits between the header image and the first row of cards, so the header image doesn't need to include any date.\n\nWant me to also prepare prompts for alternative themes (Abyss, Coral, Arctic, Tropical)?"
