          "content": "\n\nYes — here's the exact spec for the full set. You can paste this directly into Gemini (or any AI image generator) as one prompt:\n\n---\n\n**Prompt for Gemini:**\n\n```\nGenerate a matching set of 5 images for a diving club email newsletter template called \"Bulles et Aventures\". All images share the same underwater art style: painterly, slightly fantastical, warm underwater lighting, deep ocean blues (#003366 to #0077be).\n\nAll images are JPEG, no text except where specified. The images tile together to frame a 600px-wide email with white article cards in the center.\n\n1. HEADER (1200×400px)\n   - Title \"BULLES ET AVENTURES\" centered in ornate gold serif font (#d4a843), large, with text shadow\n   - Subtitle \"votre newsletter plongée\" in italic gold below\n   - NO date/month text\n   - Underwater scene: light rays from above, scattered bubbles\n   - Bottom edge fades to solid #003366\n\n2. FOOTER (1200×400px)  \n   - NO text\n   - Coral reef seabed panorama\n   - Sunken galleon wreck on the right with a club flag\n   - Scuba diver with manta ray on the left\n   - Tropical fish, wooden signpost in sand\n   - Top edge fades from solid #003366\n\n3. LEFT BORDER (90×1000px)\n   - Vertical strip, underwater scene\n   - Fish swimming upward, bubbles, seaweed\n   - Right edge fades to solid #003366 (blends with card area)\n\n4. RIGHT BORDER (90×1000px)\n   - Vertical strip, underwater scene  \n   - Shark silhouette, jellyfish, coral\n   - Left edge fades to solid #003366\n\n5. HORIZONTAL SEPARATOR (1200×60px)\n   - Thin decorative strip between the two rows of cards\n   - Bubbles, small fish, underwater particles\n   - Left and right edges fade to solid #003366\n```\n\n---\n\n**What the app expects (file names and sizes):**\n\n| File | Generate at | Displays at | Purpose |\n|------|------------|-------------|---------|\n| `header.jpg` | 1200×400 | 600×200 | Top banner with title |\n| `footer.jpg` | 1200×400 | 600×200 | Bottom scene |\n| `row1-left.jpg` | 90×1000 | 45×500 | Left border for rows 1-2 |\n| `row1-right.jpg` | 90×1000 | 45×500 | Right border for rows 1-2 |\n| `h-separator.jpg` | 1200×60 | 600×30 | Divider between row pairs |\n\nDrop them in `public/images/newsletter/bulles/` and the email template picks them up automatically.\n\n**The overlay text specs** (rendered by the app, not in the images):\n- Month label: `Georgia, serif`, 18px, `#d4a843`, italic, centered\n- Card titles: `Arial`, 14px bold, `#003366`\n- Card body: `Arial`, 12px, `#555555`\n- \"Lire la suite →\": `Arial`, 12px bold, `#0077be`\n- \"EN ›\": `Arial`, 10px, `#999999`\n\nFor a new theme, just generate 5 matching images with a different color palette and drop them in a new folder (e.g. `public/images/newsletter/tropical/`)."
