rip with small theme-appropriate details\n   - Bubbles, small creatures, underwater particles\n   - Left and right edges fade to solid primary color\n\nOutput the primary color hex code and accent color hex code used, \nso they can be configured in the email template.\n```\n\n---\n\n**Example theme lines to swap in:**\n\n| Event/Place | Theme line |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Oman trip | `Oman dive trip — warm Arabian sea, whale sharks, desert coast` |\n| Gravière du Fort | `Freshwater quarry dive in Alsace — cold green water, low visibility, training atmosphere` |\n| Juan-les-Pins | `Mediterranean summer diving — turquoise water, Posidonia meadows, grouper, calanques` |\n| Zélande (Netherlands) | `North Sea diving in Zeeland — grey-green water, lobsters, shipwrecks, tidal currents` |\n| Nemo 33 pool | `Indoor deep pool training — crystal clear blue water, platforms, bubbles, modern architecture` |\n| Christmas party | `Festive underwater holiday — Santa diver, gift boxes on seabed, fairy lights, coral Christmas tree` |\n| AG (General Assembly) | `Formal club meeting — underwater boardroom, elegant, club flag, champagne bubbles` |\n\nThe AI generates the palette from the theme, and you tell me the two hex codes it outputs — I plug them into the app's theme config."
