om right edge, dark semi-transparent backdrop\n- Contains: email + password fields, submit button, \"Forgot password?\" link, social provider buttons (filtered by configured `client_id`), EU Login button\n- Triggered by \"Login\" button in hero and sticky nav\n- Closes on backdrop click or × button\n\n**Task Breakdown:**\n\nTask 1: Add route + controller method\n- Add `Route::get('/home3', [HomeController::class, 'index3'])->name('home3');` in routes/web.php\n- Add `index3()` in HomeController: queries `EventPhoto::randomPublic(8)`, upcoming events (3), memberStats, bureau members, instructors with `show_on_public_site`\n- Pass theme settings\n- Objective: `/home3` returns view without error\n\nTask 2: Create `home3.blade.php`\n- Standalone HTML document with inline `<style>` and `<script>`\n- All 8 sections as described above\n- Slide-in login panel with form posting to `route('login')`, social buttons filtered by config\n- Hero photo cycling (JS, 6-second interval, crossfade)\n- Scroll-reveal animations (IntersectionObserver)\n- Counter animation on numbers strip\n- Sticky nav appears after scrolling past hero (logo + Login button)\n- Responsive: stacks on mobile, photo mosaic becomes 2-column\n- Objective: Full visual landing page with working login\n\nTask 3: Pint, tests, commit, deploy\n- Run `vendor/bin/pint --dirty`\n- Run `php artisan test --compact`\n- Git commit + push\n- Deploy to test.clubcep.eu\n- Objective: Live at test.clubcep.eu/home3 for review\n"
