    "## OBJECTIVE\nBuild, deploy, and mature a Laravel 11 diving club management application (DivingClub-Manager) for Club Européen de Plongée (CEP) Luxembourg. The app manages members, events, certifications, equipment, payments, newsletters, and communications. Currently in staging at test.clubcep.eu with acceptance environment on ecb.pm.\n\n## USER GUIDANCE\n- Bureau-only access for admin features\n- All mail in staging must go to eddy.collart@gmail.com only (STAGING_MODE=true)\n- Prefer standard, non-intrusive solutions (plus-addressing over Postfix hacking)\n- App should run as unprivileged user (clubcep), no sudo/root for daily operation\n- Keep original docs alongside v2 versions (don't overwrite)\n- Minimize code — only what's needed\n- Don't modify tests unless explicitly asked\n- Articles should be available in FR and EN\n- Newsletter links currently point to old Joomla site (clubcep.eu) or static pages on clubcep.ecb.pm\n- DNS for clubcep.eu is on Internet.bs (topdns.com), considering migration to Cloudflare\n\n## COMPLETED\n\n### Infrastructure (ecb.pm — 178.104.123.117)\n- Containerized acceptance env: Caddy reverse proxy, PostgreSQL 16, docker-mailserver, Roundcube webmail\n- DivingClub app at divingclub.ecb.pm (PHP-FPM + Nginx + Supervisor in container)\n- 2GB swap, SSH config pinned to IP, Resend SMTP relay configured on mailserver\n- Static article pages hosted at clubcep.ecb.pm (5 FR + 5 EN articles with YouTube embed, tables, emojis)\n\n### Infrastructure (test.clubcep.eu — 204.168.168.60)\n- Hetzner VPS, Ubuntu 24.04, PHP 8.3-FPM, Caddy, PostgreSQL, Redis\n- App user renamed from `deploy` to `clubcep` (no sudo, no docker, no root)\n- Supervisor manages Horizon daemon\n- Postfix for local mail delivery (standard plus-addressing, zero custom config)\n- Dovecot installed but not needed (Maildir mode)\n- STAGING_MODE=true, STAGING_USE_SMTP=true, MAIL_ALWAYS_TO=eddy.collart@gmail.com\n- MAIL_MAILER=resend, RESEND_KEY for clubcep.eu domain (verified)\n- CLUB_MAIL_ADDRESS=clubcep@test.clubcep.eu\n- INBOUND_MAIL_ENABLED=true, INBOUND_MAILDIR=/home/clubcep/Maildir\n\n### Code Review & Fixes (5 batches)\n1. Silent failure bug in EventController::register(), ProfileController split into 4 controllers, rate limiting, staging route security, BackupService password leak fix, admin routes extracted to routes/admin.php\n2. Cached EnsureInstalled middleware, HTMLPurifier instances, member stats, topLocations()\n3. Return type hints on all 97 model relationship methods across 48 models\n4. Article body sanitization before embed regex, HSTS header\n5. home2.blade.php renderedBody() fix, UpdateService escapeshellarg\n\n### Features Built\n- **spatie/laravel-permission**: 6 roles, 12 permissions, migrated from hand-rolled system. Legacy roles table renamed to legacy_roles. User model has HasRoles trait. All whereHas('role') replaced with Spatie's role() scope.\n- **Laravel Horizon**: Redis queue monitoring, bureau-only access, linked in admin menu\n- **Intervention Image v4**: Thumbnails (3 lines vs 15), avatar auto-resize to 400×400\n- **Resend integration**: MAIL_MAILER=resend, load-balancing across 2 API keys (clubcep.eu + ecb.pm) for 200 emails/day\n- **Federation visibility**: Active/Recognized/Invisible toggle in admin settings\n- **Sortable headers + search**: 6 admin tables (articles with cross-language search, equipment, payments, audit logs, members, classifieds)\n- **Newsletter system**: email-safe table layout, 25 SVG decorations, scatter button, editable teaser per slot, custom URL per slot, EN link in cards, test send button, mailto for comments, configurable article base URL\n- **Document library**: drag-drop upload, search, bulk ZIP download, inline image/PDF preview, \"My Documents\" section for members\n- **Translation quality**: source hash, word count validation, retry logic, auto-flagging. All 14 non-English locales complete (631 JSON keys each)\n- **Inbound mail aliases**: plus-addressing (clubcep+bureau@,